{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₁eh₂no-|*-lós}}
{{lbor|en|ML.|ānnulus}}, a misspelling of {{der|en|la|ānulus|t=ring, especially one worn on a finger}}, from {{m|la|ānus|t=ring}} (from {{der|en|ine-pro|*h₁eh₂no-|t=ring}}) + {{m|la|-ulus|pos={{glossary|diminutive}} {{glossary|suffix}}}}.<ref>Compare {{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=6046861440|date=September 2023|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>

The {{glossary|plural}} form {{m|en|annuli}} is a {{lbor|en|ML.|ānnulī|nocap=1}}.

